    "recommendation": "Validate the source and target-account scope; block or rate-limit only after confirming business impact, protect affected accounts, revoke suspicious sessions, and hunt for successful authentication after failures. For “Brute-Force Login Attempt”, explicitly compare the relevant account/source pattern and the successful/failed authentication sequence.",
