      "precautionPrevention": "Require phishing-resistant MFA where feasible; block legacy auth; review Conditional Access and risk policies; protect privileged accounts; alert on spray patterns and monitor sign-in baselines.",
      "ifCompromise": "Validate the source and target-account scope; block or rate-limit only after confirming business impact, protect affected accounts, revoke suspicious sessions, and hunt for successful authentication after failures.",
      "evidenceToCollect": "UTC timestamps; user/object ID; source IP/ASN/location; application/resource; status/error code; correlation/request IDs; device/user agent; MFA and Conditional Access details; related event IDs; user/owner validation; response actions."
