      "logsTelemetry": "DNS query logs; resolver telemetry; proxy/firewall logs; endpoint DNS/process events; passive DNS and domain reputation; network sensor metadata.",
      "investigationPivots": "Review queried domain, query type, NXDOMAIN ratio, frequency/entropy, first-seen time, resolved IP/ASN and requesting process/host. Correlate with proxy and endpoint network connections.",
