      "precautionPrevention": "Use protective DNS, log resolver queries, restrict direct external DNS where feasible, maintain egress controls and monitor unusual query patterns.",
      "ifCompromise": "Check query frequency, domain entropy/age, resolved IPs and requesting process; correlate DNS with proxy/endpoint connections before blocking.",
      "evidenceToCollect": "FQDN; query type/time/frequency; source host/IP; resolver; answers/TTL; domain age/reputation references; process; associated connections; block action and related hosts."
