      "redFlags": "External auto-forwarding; rules hiding security alerts or invoices; rule created after suspicious sign-in; unknown client/IP; mailbox delegate or OAuth grant changes. Alert-specific focus: External Email Auto-Forwarding Enabled. Validate this behavior using raw telemetry and related events; the alert title alone is not proof.",
